  "text": "\t \n\t\t Town Clerk’s Office Annoucement, Motor Vehicle State Fees – The Town of Seabrook, NH \n\t\t\t\t Welcome To \nThe Town of Seabrook, NH \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  (603) 474-3311 \n\t\t\t\t The Town of Seabrook, NH \nHome \nAbout \nBusiness & Industry \nDoing Business in Seabrook \nGroups & Organizations \nLocation & Transportation \nNewsletter \nTown \nDepartments \nCol 1 \nAssessing \nBuilding / Code Enforcement \nEmergency Management \nFinance \nFire \nHealth \nInformation Technology \nPolice \nProcurement \t\t\t \nCol 2 \nPublic Works \nRecreation \nSCTV 22 \nTax Collector \nTown Clerk \nTown Manager \nWastewater \nWater \nWelfare \t\t\t \nBoards \n& Committees \nBudget Committee \nConservation Commission \nPlanning Board \nRecreation Commission \nScholarship Committee \nBoard of Selectmen \nZoning Board of Adjustment \nForms  \n& Documents \nCalendar \nSchools \nSeabrook Elementary School \nSeabrook Middle School \nLibrary \nBeach Village \n District \nDirections  \n& Contact \t\t\t \nHome \nAbout \nBusiness & Industry \nDoing Business in Seabrook \nGroups & Organizations \nLocation & Transportation \nTown Departments \nAssessing \nBuilding / Code Enforcement \nEmergency Management \nFinance \nFire \nHealth \nInformation Technology \nPolice \nProcurement \nPublic Works \nRecreation \nSCTV 22 \nTax Collector \nTown Clerk \nTown Manager \nWastewater \nWater \nWelfare \nBoards and Committees \nBudget Committee \nConservation Commission \nPlanning Board \nRecreation Commission \nScholarship Committee \nBoard of Selectmen \nZoning Board of Adjustment \nCalendar \nSchools \nSeabrook Elementary School \nSeabrook Middle School \nLibrary \nBeach Village \n District \nDirections  \n& Contact \nALERTS:  None at this time! \nTown Clerk’s Office Annoucement, Motor Vehicle State Fees \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t\t\t Posted on November 6, 2025 at 10:33 am. \t\t \nMOTOR VEHICLE STATE FEES: The state’s budget (HB2) has passed. The budget will cause multiple changes to DMV/State fees that will take effect on January 1, 2026.  This means your vehicle registrations will cost more than usual, even if your renewal notice shows a lower fee.  Please see the spreadsheet of affected fees which has been created and provided by the state. \nDMV APPOINTMENTS: All New Hampshire DMV locations are now requiring appointments. You may visit  www.nh.dmv.gov  or call 603-227-4000 to schedule an appointment. \nSTATE INSPECTIONS: New Hampshire state inspections for private passenger vehicles in NH will no longer be required starting in January 2026 (HB649). This will eliminate the requirement of a physical safety inspection and on-board diagnostics testing for all private passenger vehicles. \nYou may contact the Town Clerk’s Office at 603-474-3152 if you have further questions. \nClick  HERE  for the updated Fees \nClick  HERE  for the DMV press release \nPost navigation \nSolid Waste (Rubbish) Policy \n2025 Tax Rate Detail \n\t\t Useful Links \nBudgets \nCapital Improvement Plan (CIP) \nTown Reports \nTown Warrants \n91A Request Form and Policy \nSuggestions / Feedback \n\t Upcoming Events \n\t\t\t\t Oct \n\t\t\t\t 19 \n\t\t\t\t Board of Selectmen \n\t\t\t\t 10:00 am \n\t\t\t\t Oct \n\t\t\t\t 19 \n\t\t\t\t Planning Board \n\t\t\t\t 6:30 pm \n\t\t\t\t Oct \n\t\t\t\t 28 \n\t\t\t\t Zoning Board \n\t\t\t\t 7:00 pm \n\t\t\t\t Nov \n\t\t\t\t 02 \n\t\t\t\t Planning Board \n\t\t\t\t 6:30 pm \n\t\t See Full Calendar \n\t Weather \n\t\t SEABROOK WEATHER \n\t Tides \n Town of Seabrook 99 Lafayette Road Seabrook, NH 03874 \n (603) 474-3311 \nEmergency Dial 911 \n ",
